WEBVTT

00:35:28.788 --> 00:35:31.871
to protect animals and now the
environment and our planet,

00:35:32.996 --> 00:35:35.246
I think you've seen, as I have,

00:35:35.246 --> 00:35:37.038
a lot of ineffective strategies

00:35:37.413 --> 00:35:40.746
for trying to get people to
care about non humans.

00:35:41.121 --> 00:35:43.913
And I'm curious about what you've
learned from all this activism.

00:35:44.246 --> 00:35:46.413
What is it that gets people
to care about animals?

00:35:46.413 --> 00:35:49.413
What is it that gets them to step up
in and take care of the planet?

00:35:50.121 --> 00:35:54.246
When I first realized that chimpanzees
were disappearing and

00:35:54.246 --> 00:35:59.121
the forests were were being
destroyed in 1986,

00:35:59.371 --> 00:36:02.871
I felt that I had to learn more about it.